  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_friend_01",
      "hash64": "0B6F503EBE96FC38",
      "text": "What’re your parents like, Nemona?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_01",
      "hash64": "2F943421E23CA2E4",
      "text": "My parents? Normal, I guess.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_01",
      "hash64": "ECC8A4A044460EC2",
      "text": "Are you serious? Even I know about your dad.\\nHe’s on the board of the Rotom Phone company![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_02",
      "hash64": "2F943721E23CA7FD",
      "text": "Wait, how do you know that?![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_02",
      "hash64": "ECC8A3A044460D0F",
      "text": "Everyone knows that. He’s famous. And I guess\\nI looked into him for my own reasons, too.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_friend_02",
      "hash64": "0B6F533EBE970151",
      "text": "So Nemona’s actually some pampered little\\nprincess from a rich family?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_03",
      "hash64": "2F943621E23CA64A",
      "text": "Ugh! No! No way! That’s so not my thing.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_04",
      "hash64": "2F943121E23C9DCB",
      "text": "Though, yeah...[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_05",
      "hash64": "2F943021E23C9C18",
      "text": "I guess you could say Mother and Father were,\\nlike...hands-off but in a good way?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_06",
      "hash64": "2F943321E23CA131",
      "text": "My big sister’ll probably take over the business,\\nso they pretty much let me do what I wanted.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_friend_03",
      "hash64": "0B6F523EBE96FF9E",
      "text": "Wait, you call them “Mother” and “Father”?![VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_03",
      "hash64": "ECC8A2A044460B5C",
      "text": "That is some pampered little princess stuff\\nright there.[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_07",
      "hash64": "2F943221E23C9F7E",
      "text": "Gaah! Cállate, Penny! What, is your family super\\nnormal, then?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_04",
      "hash64": "ECC8A1A0444609A9",
      "text": "M...my family is...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_05",
      "hash64": "ECC8A0A0444607F6",
      "text": "unbelievably annoying...[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_08",
      "hash64": "2F942D21E23C96FF",
      "text": "Like super overprotective, you mean?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_06",
      "hash64": "ECC89FA044460643",
      "text": "It’s just my dad! He’s loud and clingy and makes\\nup weird nicknames for me, like “Pen-pen.”[VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_07",
      "hash64": "ECC89EA044460490",
      "text": "He’s the most annoying guy in the world! Period!\\nHe’s the worst![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_friend_04",
      "hash64": "0B6F553EBE9704B7",
      "text": "Man, that’s a real downer...for your dad.\\nHaving his own daughter describe him like that...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_botan_08",
      "hash64": "ECC8ADA044461E0D",
      "text": "Don’t you dare take his side![VAR 0x0114(0008)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0008"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_09",
      "hash64": "2F942C21E23C954C",
      "text": "Uhhhhhh...[VAR 0x0100(0000)]! How ’bout you?\\nYour mother seemed super nice.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_friend_05",
      "hash64": "0B6F543EBE970304",
      "text": "You met her?[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_rival_10",
      "hash64": "2F912F21E23A648E",
      "text": "Yup! Got a glimpse of an amazing-looking\\nsandwich she made, too![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "atlantis_talk_04_friend_06",
      "hash64": "0B6F573EBE97081D",
      "text": "Really? Wish I could’ve seen that. I bet it tasted\\ngreat...[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
